<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>子账号与权限 · 抖音账号工作台</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/auth.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/users.css"></head>
<body><aside><div class="brand"><span class="brand-icon">矩</span><div>账号工作台<small>DOUYIN ACCOUNT BOARD</small></div></div><div class="nav-label">工作空间</div><nav><a href="/">▦　返回工作看板</a><a class="active" href="/users.html">♙　子账号与权限</a></nav><div class="sidebar-bottom">权限由总管理员统一管理<small>员工登录后共用同一份工作数据</small></div></aside>
<main><header><div><div class="breadcrumb">工作台 / 人员管理</div><h1>子账号与权限</h1><p class="permission-note">这里的子账号是员工登录工作台的账号，与抖音大号、小号分别管理。</p></div><a class="button" href="/">返回工作台</a></header>
<p id="pageError" role="alert"></p><section id="ownerContent" hidden>
<div class="access-banner"><strong>仅你的总管理员账号可以添加人员和分配权限</strong><p>所有已登录人员均可查看三个办公室的资料。下方勾选决定允许修改的内容；未勾选时只能查看。普通管理员也不能给他人授权。</p></div>
<section class="stats" id="userStats"></section>
<section class="workspace"><div class="toolbar"><input id="userSearch" aria-label="搜索人员" placeholder="搜索姓名或登录名"><select id="userFilter" aria-label="人员状态"><option value="">全部人员</option><option value="active">启用中</option><option value="disabled">已停用</option></select><button id="addPerson" class="button primary">＋ 添加子账号</button><button id="refreshPeople" class="button">刷新列表</button><button id="auditToggle" class="button">人员操作记录</button></div><div class="account-scroll"><table class="users-table"><thead><tr><th>姓名 / 登录名</th><th>角色 / 状态</th><th>已授权的操作</th><th>管理</th></tr></thead><tbody id="peopleBody"></tbody></table></div><p id="peopleCount" class="permission-note"></p></section>
<section class="workspace" id="auditSection" hidden><h2>人员与登录操作记录</h2><p class="permission-note">展示最近200条记录；不记录明文密码。</p><div id="peopleAudit" class="audit-list"></div></section>
<section class="workspace"><h2>权限说明</h2><p class="permission-note">角色是勾选模板，实际权限以每个人保存的选项为准。员工模板包含日常发布、账号状态、注册进度和手机卡待办；只读模板不含修改操作。</p><div id="permissionGuide"></div><div class="owner-only"><strong>总管理员独占</strong><p>添加员工登录账号、修改授权、停用 / 启用人员、重设员工密码、查看人员操作记录。不能转授，也不能创建第二个总管理员。</p></div></section></section>
</main>
<dialog id="personDialog"><form id="personForm"><div class="dialog-head"><div><small>总管理员设置</small><h2 id="personTitle">添加子账号</h2></div><button type="button" id="closePerson" class="text-button">关闭</button></div><input id="personId" type="hidden"><div class="form-row"><label>登录名<input id="personUsername" required minlength="3" maxlength="40" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_.-]+" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如 staff001"></label><label>员工姓名<input id="personName" required maxlength="60" autocomplete="off"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>角色模板（切换会重新勾选）<select id="personRole"><option value="employee">员工</option><option value="admin">管理员</option><option value="viewer">只读人员</option></select></label><label>登录状态<select id="personActive"><option value="yes">启用</option><option value="no">停用（不能登录）</option></select></label></div><div class="form-row"><label><span id="personPasswordLabel">初始密码</span><input id="personPassword" type="password" minlength="10" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>再次确认密码<input id="personConfirm" type="password" minlength="10" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password"></label></div><p id="passwordHint" class="permission-note"></p><div class="grant-tools"><strong>允许的操作 <span id="grantCount"></span></strong><button type="button" id="grantAll" class="text-button">全选操作</button><button type="button" id="grantNone" class="text-button">仅查看</button></div><div id="personGrants"></div><p class="permission-note">保存权限、停用或重设密码后，该人员旧登录立即失效，需重新登录。管理人员的权限始终只属于总管理员。</p><p id="personError" role="alert"></p><button type="submit" class="button primary">保存子账号与权限</button></form></dialog>
<script src="/users.js"></script></body></html>
